WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.288 --> 00:00:04.693
- Every day, I turn off
onto an old country road.

00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:08.860
It's about a mile from the
presidents, but you can see 'em.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:12.630
And then you get up to 'em
and you stand next to one

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.047
and you go, "Man, these things are huge!"

00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:20.915
How many people on Earth can
say they got a collection

00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:24.948
of presidents in their backyard
that you can see from space?

00:00:24.948 --> 00:00:28.531
(playful orchestral music)

00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:33.560
I know there's JFK. (laughing)

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.310
I have 43 presidents.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.386
And Ronald.

00:00:38.556 --> 00:00:42.723
These guys weigh approximately
14,000 to 21,000 pounds.

00:00:43.862 --> 00:00:45.718
These things are huge, aren't they?

00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:48.000
They've been here for about three years.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.458
And through time, they're
starting to enjoy being out here.

00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:53.507
They've got their wildlife.

00:00:53.507 --> 00:00:55.340
Wow, got a bees' nest.

00:00:57.616 --> 00:01:01.783
The weeds are growing up and
it's amazing; they amaze me.

00:01:05.287 --> 00:01:09.370
These statues were once
a part of a outdoor park.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.701
When the original park
had closed its doors,

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:18.184
I was asked to destroy the presidents

00:01:18.184 --> 00:01:20.101
and clean the place up.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:24.303
It hit me.

00:01:24.303 --> 00:01:26.017
I said, "I'm not destroying 'em.

00:01:26.017 --> 00:01:28.957
"I'm gonna figure out something."

00:01:28.957 --> 00:01:32.997
The feeling I get from
'em, it’s, it’s overwhelming.

00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:36.615
I mean, these guys, they
still have strength today

00:01:36.615 --> 00:01:40.782
that they had when they were
alive and forming our country.

00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:45.855
They mean a lot to me.

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:48.526
I wanna bring 'em back to a museum

00:01:48.526 --> 00:01:51.776
where they can be enjoyed by everybody.

